    "description": {
      "value": "<p><a href=\"https://amellwind-mh-dn-d5e-foundry-toolbox-2.vercel.app/weapons?weapon=Bow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Bow in the Toolbox</a></p><hr><h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature with this weapon and deal damage to it, the creature's Speed is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Coatings</strong></p><p>This weapon can apply specialized coatings that you purchase or craft as inventory items. You can apply only coating types unlocked for this weapon's rarity (and any lower rarity).</p><p><strong>Once on each of your turns (no action required),</strong> you can expend one coating vial you are carrying and make that coating your active coating. An active coating has 3 charges. It remains active until its charges are expended, you activate a different coating (any remaining charges on the previous coating are lost), or you finish a Short or Long Rest (any remaining charges are lost).</p><p>When you make a ranged attack with this bow while a coating is active, one charge is expended and the coating's effect applies as described for that coating. You still expend ammunition (arrows) as normal for the attack. Coatings do not regenerate; new vials must be bought or crafted.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Charging Sidestep</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>You leap up to 15 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks. If you make a ranged attack with this bow later on the same turn, that attack deals an extra [[/r 1d4]] piercing damage on a hit.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Dragonpiercer</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p><p>You fire an arrow in a 30-foot line that is 5 feet wide. Each creature in that line must make a Dexterity saving throw against your Bow Save DC (8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Dexterity modifier). A creature takes [[/r 4d6]] piercing damage on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, regaining all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Tracer I</strong></p><p>When you hit a creature with a ranged attack using this bow, you gain 1 Tracer (maximum 3). All Tracer fades if you haven't made an attack with this bow for 1 minute.</p><p>When you use Dragonpiercer, you can spend any number of Tracer. The shot deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] piercing damage for each Tracer spent (use the matching Dragonpiercer ×N activity).</p></div><h3>Coatings</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Power Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] piercing damage.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Close Range Coating</strong></p><p>You do not have Disadvantage on this ranged attack from a hostile creature within 5 feet of you. This coating expends a charge when you make the attack, hit or miss.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Acid Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] acid damage. <em>Crafted; not sold in standard shops.</em></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Cold Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] cold damage. <em>Crafted; not sold in standard shops.</em></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Fire Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] fire damage. <em>Crafted; not sold in standard shops.</em></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Lightning Coating</strong></p><p>On a hit, the attack deals an extra [[/r 1d6]] lightning damage. <em>Crafted; not sold in standard shops.</em></p></div>",
      "chat": "<div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Coatings</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Charging Sidestep</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Dragonpiercer</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Tracer I</strong></p></div>"
    },
